  "notes": [
    "Mandatory assembly sequence for shims: 1) mount front bracket to compressor and torque its bolts; 2) mount rear brackets to compressor and only start the bolts; 3) position front and rear brackets against the supports on the engine; 4) add shims between rear bracket and compressor as required; 5) torque the rear bracket to compressor bolts.",
    "[A] Use as required.",
    "See heater hose sht. for attaching parts. (2 places)",
    "COMPRESSOR GROUND WIRE"
  ],
